-- CAPABILITY -------- errors/role_grant_exceeded_1.march

The body of role `Cons` writes a file, but the role is granted only `IO.Console` (`role Cons needs IO.Console`). A role's grant bounds everything its code reaches, as `main`'s grant bounds the program. [role_grant_exceeded]
help: add `IO.FileWrite` to the grant in protocol `Stream`: `role Cons needs IO.Console, IO.FileWrite`. Or remove the use.

